OL,3,GNEWSAIs it too soon to think about your
OL,4,Achild's career at five?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a state-of-the-art facility in rural
OL,7,FBerkshire a group of five and
OL,8,Fsix-year-olds, wearing matching branded
OL,9,Foveralls, are designing their own
OL,10,Felectric cars with Lego bricks.
OL,12,FIt is part of a practical workshop
OL,13,Forganised by BMW in the hope it will
OL,14,Fbring engineering to life and spark an
OL,15,Finterest in the industry.
OL,17,FResearch done by the company showed 78%
OL,18,Fof parents believe AI will
OL,19,Fsignificantly change the jobs available
OL,20,Fto children while 49% do not know what
OL,21,Fskills they will need to succeed.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
